  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Forest, Agriculture and Sustainable Trade (FAST)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FAST aims to accelerate palm oil and cocoa actors (including the government and industries) to demonstrate sustainable and responsible business practices while protecting the environment and alleviating poverty. The project will also increase the readiness and adoption of certification programs that ensure sustainable practices which can provide frameworks for responsible sourcing and production, and lesson learned from timber experience to other commodities.</narrative>
  </description>
